<title>UK: L-Bank sets $250 mln four-year Eurobond, +4 b.p.</title>
<headline>L-Bank sets $250 mln four-year Eurobond, +4 b.p.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers ABN AMRO Hoare Govett and Merrill Lynch International Ltd.</p>
<p> BORROWER   L-BANK</p>
<p> AMT	  $250 MLN  COUPON     6.50	MATURITY    23.OCT.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.29    PAY DATE    23.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     REOFFER    99.89     SPREAD	+4 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 1</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.225     SELL CONC  1.40	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
